cipher-mode-error-code: TPMI_ALG_CIPHER_MODE values are rejected with TPM_RC_MODE

Classification: spec-deviation bug fix.

Specification (TPM 2.0 Library, Part 2, "TPMI_ALG_CIPHER_MODE" (Table:
Definition of (TPM_ALG_ID) TPMI_ALG_CIPHER_MODE Type)):

  "TPMI_ALG_CIPHER_MODE is an interface type of all the symmetric block
  cipher, encryption/decryption modes that are listed in the TCG algorithm
  registry. ... TPM_ALG_CTR; TPM_ALG_OFB; TPM_ALG_CBC; TPM_ALG_CFB;
  TPM_ALG_ECB; +TPM_ALG_NULL required; #TPM_RC_MODE"

The error code of the TPMI_ALG_CIPHER_MODE interface type is TPM_RC_MODE
(Part 2, TPMI_ALG_CIPHER_MODE), but version 185 returns TPM_RC_SYMMETRIC for
a mode that is not an implemented block cipher mode (e.g. TPM_ALG_CMAC in
TPM2_EncryptDecrypt).
diff --git a/TPMCmd/tpm/src/support/Marshal.c b/TPMCmd/tpm/src/support/Marshal.c
--- a/TPMCmd/tpm/src/support/Marshal.c
+++ b/TPMCmd/tpm/src/support/Marshal.c
@@ -1518,6 +1518,9 @@ const TPM_ALG_ID TPMI_ALG_CIPHER_MODE_VALUES[] = {
 };
 
 // Table "Definition of TPMI_ALG_CIPHER_MODE Type" (Part 2: Structures)
+// tpm-rs differential testing -- C-ref spec deviation fix (NOT determinism):
+// the error code of TPMI_ALG_CIPHER_MODE is TPM_RC_MODE (Part 2), not
+// TPM_RC_SYMMETRIC.
 TPM_RC
 TPMI_ALG_CIPHER_MODE_Plus_MarshalUnmarshal(
     TPMI_ALG_CIPHER_MODE* target, BYTE** buffer, INT32* size, BOOL marshal)
@@ -1528,7 +1531,7 @@ TPMI_ALG_CIPHER_MODE_Plus_MarshalUnmarshal(
                                        marshal,
                                        TPMI_ALG_CIPHER_MODE_VALUES,
                                        ARRAYSIZE(TPMI_ALG_CIPHER_MODE_VALUES),
-                                       TPM_RC_SYMMETRIC);
+                                       TPM_RC_MODE);
 }
 TPM_RC
 TPMI_ALG_CIPHER_MODE_MarshalUnmarshal(
@@ -1540,7 +1543,7 @@ TPMI_ALG_CIPHER_MODE_MarshalUnmarshal(
                                        marshal,
                                        TPMI_ALG_CIPHER_MODE_VALUES,
                                        ARRAYSIZE(TPMI_ALG_CIPHER_MODE_VALUES) - 1,
-                                       TPM_RC_SYMMETRIC);
+                                       TPM_RC_MODE);
 }
 
 // Table "Definition of TPMS_EMPTY Structure" (Part 2: Structures)
